menu "expat"

    config EXPAT_XML_GE
        bool "Enable XML general entity expansion"
        default y
        help
            Compile in general entity expansion plus the billion-laughs and
            allocation-tracker protection that goes with it. Disable it for a
            smaller parser: only the five predefined entities (amp, lt, gt,
            apos, quot) still expand; other &name; stay as that text, and
            external general entities are not loaded.

    config EXPAT_XML_DTD
        bool "Enable XML DTD support"
        default y
        depends on EXPAT_XML_GE
        help
            Compile in external DTD subsets, parameter entities, conditional
            sections, and default attributes from an external subset. Turning
            it off shrinks the library: no external subset is fetched and
            those DTD features are not applied. Requires general entities.

endmenu
